#: ../../tools/worldbank_tools.rst:61 c41b9e86f455497480a114656d1c9cfc
msgid "**Name**: ``WorldBank_get_indicator``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/worldbank_tools.rst:63 4b0ecea318164d88b9c80507c9c39950
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get World Bank development indicator data for one or "
"more countries over time. Returns economic, health, education, and social"
" development metrics from the World Development Indicators (WDI) "
"database. Covers 200+ countries with annual data going back to 1960s. "
"Example indicators: NY.GDP.MKTP.CD (GDP current USD), SP.POP.TOTL (total "
"population), SH.DYN.MORT (child mortality), SE.ADT.LITR.ZS (adult "
"literacy rate), SP.DYN.LE00.IN (life expectancy), SH.MED.PHYS.ZS "
"(physicians per 1000), EN.ATM.CO2E.PC (CO2 per capita), SL.UEM.TOTL.ZS "
"(unemployment rate)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/worldbank_tools.rst:67 f285138dd25d4b63b0288be441d48f37
msgid ""
"``country`` (string) (required) ISO 3166-1 alpha-3 country code (e.g., "
"'USA', 'GBR', 'DEU', 'CHN', 'IND', 'BRA') or 'all' for all countries, or "
"semicolon-separated codes (e.g., 'USA;GBR;DEU')"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/worldbank_tools.rst:70 0348294e35bf437ebb51f66cd150365b
msgid ""
"``indicator`` (string) (required) World Bank indicator code (e.g., "
"'NY.GDP.MKTP.CD' for GDP, 'SP.POP.TOTL' for population, 'SH.DYN.MORT' for"
" child mortality, 'SE.ADT.LITR.ZS' for literacy)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/worldbank_tools.rst:73 d2607ebff8514dbc95289dd8fbf30c2f
msgid ""
"``mrv`` (integer, null) (optional) Most recent values - number of most "
"recent years to return (e.g., 5 for last 5 years). Default returns all "
"available years."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/worldbank_tools.rst:76 d5b94ce8245843d2abd8bfc6d6f5df72
msgid ""
"``date`` (string, null) (optional) Year or year range to filter data "
"(e.g., '2020', '2015:2023' for a range)"
msgstr ""

